msgid ""
"Advertise subnet routes behind this device. Select from the detected subnets "
"below or enter custom routes (comma-separated)."
msgstr ""
"Fógair bealaí fo-líonra taobh thiar den fheiste seo. Roghnaigh ó na fo-"
"líonraí a braitheadh thíos nó cuir isteach bealaí saincheaptha (scartha le "
"camóga)."

#: applications/luci-app-tailscale-community/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tailscale.js:80
msgid "Allow LAN Access"
msgstr "Ceadaigh Rochtain LAN"

#: applications/luci-app-tailscale-community/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tailscale.js:78
