msgstr "Earráid stádais Tailscale"

#: applications/luci-app-tailscale-community/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tailscale.js:689
msgid ""
"The Tailscale to WAN forwarding is what lets clients send their internet "
"traffic through this device as an Exit Node."
msgstr ""
"Is é an t-atreorú ó Tailscale go WAN a ligeann do chliaint a dtrácht idirlín "
"a sheoladh tríd an ngléas seo mar Nód Scoir."

#: applications/luci-app-tailscale-community/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tailscale.js:822
msgid "This can take up to 30 seconds."
msgstr "Féadfaidh sé seo suas le 30 soicind a thógáil."

#: applications/luci-app-tailscale-community/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tailscale.js:852
msgid ""
"This will disconnect this device from your Tailnet and require you to re-"
"authenticate."
msgstr ""
"Déanfaidh sé seo an gléas seo a dhícheangal ó do Tailnet agus beidh ort "
"athfhíordheimhniú."

#: applications/luci-app-tailscale-community/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tailscale.js:203
