msgid ""
"UDP port for the Peer Relay service. Open this port on your router firewall/"
"NAT."
msgstr ""
"Port UDP don tseirbhís Athsheolta Piaraí. Oscail an port seo ar bhalla "
"dóiteáin/NAT do ródaire."

