msgid ""
"When enabled, blocks all inbound connections from the Tailscale network."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bhíonn sé cumasaithe, cuireann sé bac ar gach nasc isteach ón líonra "
"Tailscale."

#: applications/luci-app-tailscale-community/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tailscale.js:80
msgid "When using the exit node, access to the local LAN is allowed."
msgstr "Agus an nód scoir in úsáid, ceadaítear rochtain ar an LAN áitiúil."

