"You have unapplied changes. Save & Apply them first so the firewall matches "
"the form."
msgstr ""
"Tá athruithe agat nár cuireadh i bhfeidhm. Sábháil agus cuir i bhfeidhm iad "
"ar dtús, ionas go mbeidh an balla dóiteáin ar aon dul leis an bhfoirm."

#: applications/luci-app-tailscale-community/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tailscale.js:748
msgid ""
"[Important] Log in to the Tailscale admin console and manually enable "
"\"Subnet Routes\" for this device."
msgstr ""
"[Tábhachtach] Logáil isteach i gconsól riarthóra Tailscale agus cumasaigh "
"\"Bealaí Fo-líonra\" de láimh don fheiste seo."

#: applications/luci-app-tailscale-community/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tailscale.js:771
msgid ""
"[Important] Step 3 cannot be done here: it needs your Tailscale account."
msgstr ""
